**Taerian** is one of the four Viaan nations. The Kingdom has historically been on friendly terms with [[enkoa|Enkoa]]. That alliance has allowed them to expand eastward and conquer the remainder of the Mesaris Coast, but the realm is very decentralized.

-----

# History

# Geography
## Salene
The Salene province is centered around the Salene river. It holds the keys to power in Kissos and Rethia
* *[[kissos|Kissos]]*, ancient city and capital of the kingdom
* Eratinon
* Pyrgos
* Romesion
* Rethia
* Kislar
* Solakion

## Mesaris
The Mesaris coast cities are former fishing villages turned into trading ports. It is one of the most loyal provinces in the kingdom.
* *Achileion*, largest trading port in the kingdom
* Alestia
* Nembros
* Peraia
* Skopos
* Kambos
* Dhosi

## Nyma
The Nyma region is in the highlands of Taerian and produces the most marble in the entire kingdom.
* *Khalkeron*, the city of marble.
* Neokhori
* Temeni
* Andas
* Malekion
* Krana
* Thamna

